# Runtime dependencies for the AmneziaWG Web UI: what we choose, edited by hand.
#
# Flask is the only direct one: live updates are Server-Sent Events and outbound
# HTTPS is the standard library's. requirements.txt is generated from this file and
# pins every package Flask brings, so the image and the tests run the same versions
# and a rebuild never changes one by itself. Never edit requirements.txt by hand;
# bump with (DEVELOPMENT.md §11):
#
#   uv pip compile web-ui/requirements.in -o web-ui/requirements.txt \
#       --python-version 3.14 --python-platform linux --upgrade
#
# (--upgrade-package <name> for one; without either, the existing pins are kept.)
flask
